<Base title="Contact, Corrections & Feedback" description="Tell Sunnah Tools about an incorrect reference, calculator error, broken link or accessibility problem.">
<article class="content editorial-guide">
 <h1>Contact and corrections</h1>
 <p>If a calculator appears wrong, an Islamic reference is incorrect, or something is difficult to use, please tell the Sunnah Tools maintainers through the project's public issue tracker.</p>
 <h2>Report a problem</h2>
 <p><a href="https://github.com/omairarshad/sunnah-tools/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a new Sunnah Tools issue on GitHub ↗</a>. A GitHub sign-in may be required. Include the tool URL, what went wrong, what you expected, and a reliable source if you are questioning the explanation. Browser and device details can help with technical faults.</p>
 <h2>Protect personal information</h2>
 <p><strong>GitHub issues are public.</strong> Do not include passwords, financial balances, medical records, account identifiers, precise location details or other personal information. Sunnah Tools currently has no private support inbox and does not offer account-specific support.</p>
 <h2>How corrections are handled</h2>
 <p>We check reports against available source references and calculation tests. Our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial standards</a> explain the site's scope and limitations. We cannot promise individual replies or a particular resolution time.</p>
 <p>For the handling of browser data, optional analytics and advertising, see the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
 <p><a href="/#tools">← Browse all tools</a></p>
</article>
